    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417540/extras/2054bbc2cc7cd2abd269dd62cc88a0e7.poster.avif?t=1731342469\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417540/extras/2054bbc2cc7cd2abd269dd62cc88a0e7.webm?t=1731342469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417540/extras/2054bbc2cc7cd2abd269dd62cc88a0e7.mp4?t=1731342469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Gravity Block is a minimalist game. Rotate screen so that the block reaches portal.</strong><br><br><br><strong>Featuring:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Use screen buttons to rotate scene. Make the block reach the portal without touching the thorns;<br></li><li> 53 handmade levels. From the simplest to the most complex;<br></li><li> Black and White Game</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417540/extras/2054bbc2cc7cd2abd269dd62cc88a0e7.poster.avif?t=1731342469\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417540/extras/2054bbc2cc7cd2abd269dd62cc88a0e7.webm?t=1731342469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417540/extras/2054bbc2cc7cd2abd269dd62cc88a0e7.mp4?t=1731342469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Gravity Block is a minimalist game. Rotate screen so that the block reaches portal.</strong><br><br><br><strong>Featuring:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Use screen buttons to rotate scene. Make the block reach the portal without touching the thorns;<br></li><li> 53 handmade levels. From the simplest to the most complex;<br></li><li> Black and White Game</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Gravity Block is a minimalist game. Rotate screen so that the block reaches portal.",
